{"item_uid": "學測101-math-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占65分）", "stem": "三角形ABC是一個邊長為 3 的正三角形，如下圖所示。若在每一邊的兩個三等分點中，各\n選取一點連成三角形，則下列哪些選項是正確的？ A\n(1) 依此方法可能連成的三角形一共有8個\n(2) 這些可能連成的三角形中，恰有2個是銳角三角形\n(3) 這些可能連成的三角形中，恰有3個是直角三角形\n(4) 這些可能連成的三角形中，恰有3個是鈍角三角形\n(5) 這些可能連成的三角形中，恰有1個是正三角形 B C\n- 3 -\n101年學測 第 4 頁\n數學考科 共 7 頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "1,2", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 64.0, "2": 64.0, "3": 23.0, "4": 29.0, "5": 17.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 87.0, "2": 73.0, "3": 8.0, "4": 9.0, "5": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 37.0, "2": 57.0, "3": 39.0, "4": 47.0, "5": 31.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [84.0, 64.0, 50.0, 36.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測101-math-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占65分）", "stem": "設O為複數平面上的原點，並令點A,B分別代表非零複數z,w。若AOB90，則下列哪些\n選項必為負實數？\nz\n(1)\nw\n(2) zw\n(3) (zw)2\nz2\n(4)\nw2\n(5) (zw)2 （其中w為w的共軛複數）\nax8y c 3xby d", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "4,5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"1": 35.0, "2": 42.0, "3": 38.0, "4": 59.0, "5": 61.0}, "option_dist_H": {"1": 10.0, "2": 17.0, "3": 30.0, "4": 83.0, "5": 79.0}, "option_dist_L": {"1": 55.0, "2": 58.0, "3": 41.0, "4": 40.0, "5": 46.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 36.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 51.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 45.0, 26.0, 17.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
